 "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "5406731", "author": {"steamid": "76561198049267055", "personaname": "Mister Mann", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/mrsqueezecheese/", "num_games_owned": 633, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 630, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 503, "last_played": 1382596646, "avatar": "88d1f257e4a2de1422dd710f9d4025fa9f79f8a5"}, "language": "english", "review": "Come for the hat, stay for the game, nuff' said.", "timestamp_created": 1379392904, "timestamp_updated": 1379392904, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "7147679", "author": {"steamid": "76561198088701009", "personaname": "dodof", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198088701009/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 34, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 32, "last_played": 1419968432, "avatar": "7f1e32fafcb3e21eafb99f8ba85d3689d41cd095"}, "language": "english", "review": "sad", "timestamp_created": 1379329895, "timestamp_updated": 1379329895, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "4374390", "author": {"steamid": "76561198036140889", "personaname": "MeaslyTripod", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/MeaslyTripod/", "num_games_owned": 2070, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 561, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 561, "last_played": 1379487876, "avatar": "8316ba776e154ed8661d1c02a92292e931b542af"}, "language": "english", "review": "A Valve-made \"free\" co-op TPS in which up to 4 players play against a horde of aliens. A hat for \"Team Fortress 2\" wearable by all classes can be obtained by completing 2 co-op missions online. It's very fun to play with team though you'll have great trouble finding mates unless you have some friends to play...co-op mode is almost dead! :( Remember not to reload until you run out of ammo in the clip or remaining ammo in that clip will be lost. Despite its potential, there's just 1 campaign, no support for Steam Workshop...this is the most underappreciated of all Valve's game.\n\n(Japanese translation below)\n\n==================================================\n\nエイリアンの大群相手に戦う、最大4人まで参加可能なValve製の無料で遊べる協力プレイ型TPS。\nco-opモードで2ステージを攻略するとTeam Fortress 2で全クラスが使える帽子が貰えます。\nかなりの過疎状態でフレンドを呼ばない限りチームを組むのは困難ですが、チームさえ組めれば大いに楽しめます。\nリロードの度に弾倉内の残弾が消滅する仕様なので撃ち尽くすまでリロードは控えましょう。\nゲームとして発展できる余地があるにも関わらずキャンペーンは1つ、ワークショップにも非対応というValve作品の中で最も不遇な扱いを受けている作品です。", "timestamp_created": 1379323009, "timestamp_updated": 1379323009, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.511087238788604736", "comment_count": 6, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}]}